#, python-format
msgid ""
"%(amount)s is still due. Record the payment before checking out, or the invoice will show it as "
"unpaid."
msgstr ""
"%(amount)s reste dû. Enregistrez le paiement avant le départ, sinon la facture l'indiquera comme "
"impayé."

